# Python — the classifier in model/
#
# The virtual environment was committed once, which put every TensorFlow wheel
# in the repository and made the checkout useless on any other machine: the
# scripts in .venv/Scripts hard-code the absolute path of the Python that built
# them, so it pointed at a user directory that does not exist elsewhere. Build
# it locally from requirements.txt instead.
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Photographs people upload to the classifier's demo page, and the shuffled
# copy of the dataset that split_dataset.py writes.
model/uploads/
model/dataset_split/

